    "detailed_description": "Maze is a First Person Puzzle Adventure game. Solve puzzles, collect coins, and escape mind blowing labyrinths. Over 30 Mazes to conquer! Solve Mazes alone or race against a friend to the finish in Multiplayer Mode! Go for the high score in Arcade Mode, a timed mode in which you race through Stages trying to collect all the coins before time runs out!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Single Player with over 30 unique Mazes to solve!<br></li><li> Multiplayer mode including 3 Maps. Race through Mazes to see who can finish faster!<br></li><li> Arcade Mode with 4 unique Stages. Run through each Stage collecting as many coins as possible before time runs out!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Maze is a First Person Puzzle Adventure game. Solve puzzles, collect coins, and escape mind blowing labyrinths. Over 30 Mazes to conquer! Solve Mazes alone or race against a friend to the finish in Multiplayer Mode! Go for the high score in Arcade Mode, a timed mode in which you race through Stages trying to collect all the coins before time runs out!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Single Player with over 30 unique Mazes to solve!<br></li><li> Multiplayer mode including 3 Maps. Race through Mazes to see who can finish faster!<br></li><li> Arcade Mode with 4 unique Stages. Run through each Stage collecting as many coins as possible before time runs out!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Maze is a First Person Puzzle Adventure game. Enter the labyrinth, solve puzzles, collect coins, and find the finish! Over 30 Mazes to conquer and escape from.",
